### ============================================================================
### TRUE COMMUNITY - REST API TEST SCRIPT
### ============================================================================
### These requests target the endpoints that ACTUALLY exist in the codebase.
### Run with the IntelliJ HTTP Client or the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
###
### IMPORTANT PRECONDITIONS
### 1. Start MySQL + the app:  docker compose up -d  &&  ./mvnw spring-boot:run
### 2. Session: the HTTP client keeps cookies within a single run, so the login
###    request below establishes the session used by the authenticated calls.
### 3. CSRF: Spring Security CSRF protection is ON (by design - this is a
###    server-rendered MVC app). A token-less POST/PATCH/DELETE returns 403.
###    The real write flows happen through Thymeleaf forms that carry the CSRF
###    token. To exercise the JSON write endpoints from this file you must
###    either (a) run them through a browser session, or (b) temporarily relax
###    CSRF for /api/** in SecurityConfig for LOCAL testing only. Do NOT commit
###    a disabled-CSRF configuration.
###
### WHAT IS REST vs WHAT IS MVC-ONLY
###   REST (JSON):   statement reads, consensus, votes, comments, editor
###                  decision, users/leaderboard.
###   MVC-only:      registration (POST /register form), comment up/down votes
###                  (POST /arena/comments/{id}/vote), evidence (created
###                  implicitly with a vote), dashboards, editor desk actions.
###   Not implemented as endpoints: standalone reports/topics/activity/trust-log
###                  REST APIs (see README "Known technical debt").
###
### Seed data (fresh ex4 schema, see DataInitializer):
###   - 10 topics (ids 1..10), Hebrew names: 1=חוץ 2=ביטחון 3=כלכלה ...
###   - 13 statements (ids 1..13). #1..#8 PENDING, #9..#10 UNDER_REVIEW,
###     #11..#12 DECIDED. Statement 1 -> topic {3}; statement 2 -> {2,3}.
###   - Editor account: editor@truecommunity.local / editor123
###   - 30 demo users: user1..user30@example.com / password123

@host = http://localhost:8080
@api = http://localhost:8080/api
@editorEmail = editor@truecommunity.local
@editorPassword = editor123
@userEmail = user1@example.com
@userPassword = password123

### ============================================================================
### 0. PUBLIC READS (no auth required)
### ============================================================================

### Root / feed page (HTML) -> 200
GET {{host}}/

### Get statement by id -> 200 JSON
GET {{api}}/statements/1
Accept: application/json

### Get missing statement -> 404
GET {{api}}/statements/999999
Accept: application/json

### Non-numeric id -> 400 (type mismatch)
GET {{api}}/statements/abc
Accept: application/json

### Pending statements -> 200 JSON array
GET {{api}}/statements/pending
Accept: application/json

### Search: no filters -> pending statements
GET {{api}}/statements/search
Accept: application/json

### Search by keyword (Hebrew text in seed) -> 200
GET {{api}}/statements/search?keyword=אינפלציה
Accept: application/json

### Search by status -> 200
GET {{api}}/statements/search?status=PENDING
Accept: application/json

### Search by topic name (M2M join, case-insensitive) -> 200
GET {{api}}/statements/search?topic=כלכלה
Accept: application/json

### Leaderboard (public) -> 200
GET {{api}}/users/leaderboard
Accept: application/json

### Get user by id -> 200
GET {{api}}/users/1
Accept: application/json

### Missing user -> 404
GET {{api}}/users/999999
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================================
### 1. CONSENSUS (public)
### ============================================================================

### Verdict consensus -> 200
GET {{api}}/statements/1/consensus
Accept: application/json

### Verdict consensus, missing statement -> 404
GET {{api}}/statements/999999/consensus
Accept: application/json

### Topic consensus (dynamic, computed from vote_topics) -> 200
GET {{api}}/statements/1/topic-consensus
Accept: application/json

### Topic consensus, missing statement -> 404
GET {{api}}/statements/999999/topic-consensus
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================================
### 2. REGISTRATION (MVC form, NOT a REST endpoint)
### ============================================================================
### Registration is handled by AuthController via a Thymeleaf form at
### POST /register (application/x-www-form-urlencoded), not JSON. Duplicate
### email/username and password mismatch are re-displayed inline on the form.

### Register a new user (requires CSRF token in a real browser session) -> 302 /login
POST {{host}}/register
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=newuser123&email=newuser123@test.com&password=password123&confirmPassword=password123

### ============================================================================
### 3. AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================================================

### Login as editor -> 302 /feed + JSESSIONID
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{editorEmail}}&password={{editorPassword}}

### Login wrong password -> 302 /login?error
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{editorEmail}}&password=wrongpass

### Protected page while unauthenticated -> 302 /login (run after logout)
GET {{host}}/dashboard

### ============================================================================
### 4. VOTING  (authenticated; run section 3 editor/user login first)
### ============================================================================
### Endpoint: POST /api/statements/{statementId}/votes  (CSRF required)
### Crowdsourced classification: every vote suggests exactly one topic (suggestedTopicId).

### Vote: success, suggested topic + evidence -> 201
POST {{api}}/statements/1/votes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verdict": "TRUE",
  "explanation": "Confirmed by the official report.",
  "suggestedTopicId": 3,
  "evidenceUrl": "https://www.gov.il/",
  "evidenceDescription": "Official source"
}

### Vote: success, suggested topic, no evidence -> 201
POST {{api}}/statements/2/votes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verdict": "MISLEADING",
  "suggestedTopicId": 2
}

### Vote: duplicate on same statement -> 409
POST {{api}}/statements/1/votes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verdict": "FALSE",
  "suggestedTopicId": 3
}

### Vote: missing verdict -> 400
POST {{api}}/statements/3/votes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "suggestedTopicId": 3
}

### Vote: invalid verdict enum -> 400
POST {{api}}/statements/3/votes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verdict": "PARTIALLY_TRUE",
  "suggestedTopicId": 300000
}

### Vote: missing suggested topic -> 400 (a topic suggestion is required)
POST {{api}}/statements/3/votes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verdict": "TRUE"
}

### Vote: non-existent suggested topic id -> 400 (InvalidTopicSelection)
POST {{api}}/statements/3/votes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verdict": "TRUE",
  "suggestedTopicId": 999999
}

### Vote: non-existent statement -> 404
POST {{api}}/statements/999999/votes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verdict": "TRUE",
  "suggestedTopicId": 3
}

### ============================================================================
### 5. COMMENTS  (read public; write authenticated + CSRF)
### ============================================================================

### List comments for a statement -> 200, newest first
GET {{api}}/statements/1/comments
Accept: application/json

### Add comment -> 201
POST {{api}}/statements/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "This matches the cited source."
}

### Add comment, blank content -> 400
POST {{api}}/statements/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "   "
}

### Comment on non-existent statement -> 404
POST {{api}}/statements/999999/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "hello"
}

### ============================================================================
### 6. EDITOR DECISIONS  (editor session required; CSRF)
### ============================================================================
### Endpoint: POST/GET /api/editor/statements/{statementId}/decision
### /api/editor/** requires ROLE_EDITOR (403 for normal users).

### Publish decision (editor) -> 201; statement becomes DECIDED, trust scores update
POST {{api}}/editor/statements/1/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "finalVerdict": "TRUE",
  "notes": "Confirmed by authoritative sources."
}

### Duplicate decision on same statement -> 409
POST {{api}}/editor/statements/1/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "finalVerdict": "FALSE",
  "notes": "Second attempt."
}

### Missing finalVerdict -> 400
POST {{api}}/editor/statements/3/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "no verdict"
}

### Decision on non-existent statement -> 404
POST {{api}}/editor/statements/999999/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "finalVerdict": "TRUE"
}

### Get existing decision -> 200
GET {{api}}/editor/statements/1/decision
Accept: application/json

### Get decision, none published -> 404
GET {{api}}/editor/statements/3/decision
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================================
### 7. AUTHORIZATION EDGE CASES  (log in as a normal USER first - section 3)
### ============================================================================

### USER login
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{userEmail}}&password={{userPassword}}

### Normal USER attempts editor decision -> 403
POST {{api}}/editor/statements/2/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "finalVerdict": "TRUE"
}

### Normal USER attempts to read editor decision -> 403
GET {{api}}/editor/statements/1/decision
Accept: application/json

### Logout
POST {{host}}/logout

### Vote while unauthenticated -> 401/403
POST {{api}}/statements/2/votes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verdict": "TRUE",
  "suggestedTopicId": 3
}

### ============================================================================
### 8. MALFORMED / CONTENT-TYPE / ROUTING EDGE CASES
### ============================================================================

### Malformed JSON body -> 400
POST {{api}}/statements/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "broken

### Wrong Content-Type -> 415
POST {{api}}/statements/1/comments
Content-Type: text/plain

This is not JSON.

### Method not allowed (no DELETE on this route) -> 405
DELETE {{api}}/statements/1

### Unknown endpoint -> 404
GET {{api}}/not-a-real-endpoint
Accept: application/json
